---

---

<section class="tech-section">
  <h2 class="tech-section-title">Vue d'ensemble de l'architecture</h2>
  <p class="tech-section-intro">
    Éclaire repose sur trois composants principaux, conçus pour fonctionner
    indépendamment tout en se nourrissant mutuellement :
  </p>

  <div class="arch-diagram-html">
    <div class="arch-label">FLUX DE DONNÉES</div>

    <div class="arch-row">
      <div class="arch-box">
        <h3>Collecte</h3>
        <p>Scraping automatisé</p>
        <p>Extraction IA</p>
        <span class="arch-box-label">n8n</span>
      </div>

      <div class="arch-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 60 12" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <line
            x1="0"
            y1="6"
            x2="55"
            y2="6"
            stroke="#2b4888"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-dasharray="4 4"></line>
          <polygon points="60,6 50,1 50,11" fill="#2b4888"></polygon>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <div class="arch-box">
        <h3>Base de données</h3>
        <p>Organisations</p>
        <p>Événements, news</p>
        <span class="arch-box-label">PostgreSQL</span>
      </div>

      <div class="arch-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 60 12" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <line
            x1="0"
            y1="6"
            x2="55"
            y2="6"
            stroke="#2b4888"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-dasharray="4 4"></line>
          <polygon points="60,6 50,1 50,11" fill="#2b4888"></polygon>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <div class="arch-box">
        <h3>Interface</h3>
        <p>Carte interactive</p>
        <p>Recherche IA</p>
        <span class="arch-box-label">Astro + Alpine</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="arch-down-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 12 60" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <line
          x1="6"
          y1="0"
          x2="6"
          y2="55"
          stroke="#2b4888"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-dasharray="4 4"></line>
        <polygon points="6,60 1,50 11,50" fill="#2b4888"></polygon>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <div class="arch-box arch-box-llm">
      <h3>Assistant conversationnel</h3>
      <span class="arch-box-label-light"
        >Qwen 235B (planificateur de requêtes)</span
      >
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .tech-section {
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .tech-section-title {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    color: #1f2937;
  }

  .tech-section-intro {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #374151;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .arch-diagram-html {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .arch-label {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #6b7280;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .arch-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .arch-box {
    flex: 1;
    background: white;
    border: 2px solid #2b4888;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1rem 0.75rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    min-height: 130px;
  }

  .arch-box h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1f2937;
  }

  .arch-box p {
    margin: 0.1rem 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #4b5563;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .arch-box-label {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #6b7280;
  }

  .arch-arrow {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 60px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .arch-arrow svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 12px;
  }

  .arch-down-arrow {
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
    height: 50px;
  }

  .arch-down-arrow svg {
    height: 50px;
    width: 12px;
  }

  .arch-box-llm {
    background: #c73b5d;
    border-color: #c73b5d;
    max-width: 320px;
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    min-height: auto;
  }

  .arch-box-llm h3 {
    color: white;
  }

  .arch-box-label-light {
    margin-top: 0.3rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .tech-section-title {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
    }

    .arch-row {
      flex-direction: column;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 320px;
      gap: 0;
    }

    .arch-box {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: auto;
      padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
    }

    .arch-arrow {
      width: 12px;
      height: 50px;
      padding: 0.5rem 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .arch-arrow::before {
      content: "";
      display: block;
      width: 2px;
      height: 30px;
      background-image: linear-gradient(
        to bottom,
        #2b4888 50%,
        transparent 50%
      );
      background-size: 2px 8px;
      background-repeat: repeat-y;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .arch-arrow::after {
      content: "";
      display: block;
      width: 0;
      height: 0;
      border-style: solid;
      border-width: 8px 5px 0 5px;
      border-color: #2b4888 transparent transparent transparent;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .arch-arrow svg {
      display: none;
    }

    .arch-box-llm {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 320px;
      padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
